      "writtenOn": "2023-02-27T09:45:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this is going to work with aosp/2455073 because that is on master branch, whereas this is only for common-android-mainline. This isn\u0027t to actually enable Rust in the kernel, it\u0027s just the first step to get the kernel build with CONFIG_RUST_IS_AVAILABLE\u003dy set.",
      "revId": "72adc0e4c610b9d50571eccd57b26f4b6f6cae47",
