      "writtenOn": "2023-02-27T10:55:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e maennich@ from chat: in order to make this a little long term sustainable, can you work with umendez@ (London) and elsk@(MTV) on how to make this nice? in particular, we need to avoid the circular dependency between kernel/build and kernel/common.\n\nWill do.",
      "revId": "72adc0e4c610b9d50571eccd57b26f4b6f6cae47",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
